  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GLOBAL ACTION PLAN CHILD WASTING</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This WHO partnership programme will advance the delivery of Ireland&#x2019;s commitments at the UN Food Systems Summit 2021, and more specifically will provide substantial input for Ireland&#x2019;s pledge at UNGA 2022 to tackle Child Wasting (&#x20AC;50 million over 3 years) in collaboration with USAID. This &#x20AC;2 million grant to WHO will complement the larger &#x20AC;10 million grant to UNICEF to reduce the prevalence of child wasting and increase the coverage of prevention and treatment services. It will support WHO and UNICEF to pursue joint efforts in implementing the UN Global Action Plan (GAP) on Child Wasting.</narrative>
  </description>
